---
// BeP02VersionHomes: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2n">
  <div class="bep2n-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 276" role="img" aria-label="Three places a version can live. In the URL path, like /v1/cases. In a request header, like GitHub X-GitHub-Api-Version, with bare paths. Pinned per account, like Stripe dated versions, which only move when your code opts in. In all three a breaking change ships under a new version.">
<rect x="20" y="20" width="270" height="196" rx="10" class="box" />
<text x="36" y="50" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>in the URL path</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong URL path</tspan></text>
<rect x="34" y="72" width="242" height="28" rx="6" class="boxr" />
<text x="46" y="91" class="r">GET /v1/cases/3</text>
<text x="36" y="160" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>visible in every log,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhìn thấy trong mọi log,</tspan></text>
<text x="36" y="182" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>cacheable per version</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cache được theo từng version</tspan></text>
<rect x="315" y="20" width="270" height="196" rx="10" class="box" />
<text x="331" y="50" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>in a request header</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong request header</tspan></text>
<rect x="329" y="72" width="242" height="28" rx="6" class="band" />
<text x="341" y="91" class="b">GET /cases/3</text>
<rect x="329" y="106" width="242" height="28" rx="6" class="boxr" />
<text x="341" y="125" class="r">X-GitHub-Api-Version</text>
<text x="331" y="160" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>GitHub keeps paths bare</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GitHub để path trần</tspan></text>
<text x="331" y="182" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>and pins the version here</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và ghim version ở đây</tspan></text>
<rect x="610" y="20" width="270" height="196" rx="10" class="box" />
<text x="626" y="50" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>pinned per account</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghim theo account</tspan></text>
<rect x="624" y="72" width="242" height="28" rx="6" class="boxr" />
<text x="636" y="91" class="r">account → 2026-11-18.endive</text>
<rect x="624" y="106" width="242" height="28" rx="6" class="band" />
<text x="636" y="125" class="b">opt in: Stripe-Version header</text>
<text x="626" y="160" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Stripe moves you only when</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Stripe chỉ chuyển bạn khi</tspan></text>
<text x="626" y="182" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>your code opts in</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>code của bạn chọn chuyển</tspan></text>
<text x="450" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>behind all three: a breaking change ships under a new version, never under a live one</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sau cả ba kiểu: thay đổi phá vỡ luôn ra dưới version mới, không bao giờ dưới version đang sống</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Where the version lives is a design choice; the rule behind all three homes is the same.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Version sống ở đâu là lựa chọn thiết kế; quy tắc sau cả ba chỗ ở đều như nhau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2n { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2n-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2n svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2n text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2n .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep2n .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep2n .bb { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2n .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2n .f { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep2n .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2n .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2n .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2n .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2n .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2n .d { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep2n .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2n .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2n .xr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2n .ok { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2n .band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2n .bandr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2n .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2n .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2n figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
